<p>A pre-dawn explosion struck the Dalí nightclub in Trujillo on Peru’s northern coast, injuring at least 33 people, including three minors, according to local authorities and emergency officials. Officials said at least five people were seriously injured, and media reports described a chaotic scene as people scrambled for help after the blast. Investigators had not identified a suspect, and no group had claimed responsibility as of the reporting. The blast comes as Peru has seen a rise in organized crime and extortion in recent years—a trend some analysts tie to government corruption—though the motive in this case remained unclear.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Ages of minors: Officials said the injured minors were a 16-year-old and two 17-year-olds.</li><li>Conflicting early injury tallies: Early reports put the number of injured at at least 31, while authorities later said 33.</li><li>Administrative location detail: AP described the site as Trujillo in Peru’s La Libertad Department.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Local emergency officials: The local emergency operations center said the explosion happened in the pre-dawn hours at the Dalí nightclub in Trujillo along Peru’s northern coast and provided the initial official account of the incident. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/07/peru-nightclub-bombing'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Peruvian authorities and police: Authorities said they were investigating the incident and had not yet identified who was responsible. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/peru-nightclub-bombing-injuries-crime-police/article70716900.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Analysts cited in reporting: Analysts cited in coverage linked Peru’s broader uptick in organized crime and extortion to government corruption, while reporting emphasized that the motive for this blast was still unknown. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/7/more-than-30-injured-in-nightclub-bombing-in-northern-peru'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/peru-nightclub-bombing-injuries-crime-police/article70716900.ece'>Bombing at Peru nightclub injures at least 33, including minors: authorities</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/07/peru-nightclub-bombing'>Bombing at nightclub in Peru injures 33 people, including minors</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/peru-trujillo-dali-nightclub-bombing/'>Bombing at nightclub in Peru injures 33, including minors, authorities say</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/bombing-at-peru-nightclub-injures-33-people-including-minors'>Bombing at Peru nightclub injures 33 people, including minors</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/7/more-than-30-injured-in-nightclub-bombing-in-northern-peru'>More than 30 injured in nightclub bombing in northern Peru</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/over-30-hurt-in-peru-after-nightclub-explosion-causes-chaos'>Over 30 hurt in Peru after nightclub explosion causes chaos</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/nightclub-bombing-peru-injures-33-including-minors-authorities-130859546'>A nightclub bombing in Peru injures 33, including minors, authorities say</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://apnews.com/article/peru-bombing-nightclub-dali-a2e17ca032cfd0dd54a06c91b4d951a2'>At least 33 people are injured, including three minors and five others seriously, in a bombing at a nightclub in Trujillo, La Libertad Department, Peru. No group has yet claimed responsibility.</a> - apnews.com</li></ul>